{"id":"vod_sn_35913","vodId":"35913","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"宇宙巡警露露子","name_cn":"宇宙巡警露露子","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/395cbea0771988642c074c3cec1c0cfc.jpg"},"summary":"《宇宙巡警露露子》是由今石洋之指导，TRIGGER五周年纪念的短篇原创电视动画作品。据称位于银河系中心的宇宙巡警本部。由那里所指定的，太阳系边境宇宙移民特区OGIKUBO。自移民开始后20年，宇宙偏差值最低的宇宙贫民街建成了。父亲是宇宙巡警的刑警，普通的女初中生露露子，某天为了救助突然遭到冻结的父亲而造访了宇宙巡警OGIKUBO支部，在那里被Over Justice本部长任命为宇宙巡警。在穿上机能略有改变的宇宙巡警套装后，露露子能否拯救父亲，从宇宙罪犯的魔手中守护OGIKUBO的和平，以及兼顾初中生本分的“恋爱”与“学业”呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:38:48","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GCy6D9gjkT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nDRGw364Mi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qQRPUUEnRU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SDVRLdCw3G1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aqceZd5S1Y1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FSujFdzEj21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ETQpAqLYxZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dNS0u5ckK31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JAEHqmAfPH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jpyhp2Pw7y1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sX8XUYiZH91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xbaETvfH931/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eGdL3GL6h71/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:29.086Z"}